# Memory Trick 🧠

```
Eventual Consistency Problems

RYOW
→ "I changed it, why can't I see it?"
→ Read Primary

Monotonic Reads
→ "Time should never go backwards."
→ Same Replica

Consistent Prefix Reads
→ "Cause should always come before Effect."
→ Same Partition
```

> **Golden Rule:** Eventual Consistency is a **performance optimization**. We don't eliminate its inconsistencies completely—we apply techniques like **Session Consistency**, **Sticky Replicas**, and **Causal Ordering** to hide them from users and provide a much smoother experience.